beta period ends — see Section 4.

The first 20–30 active beta testers may, at Northbyte Studios' sole
discretion, receive a complimentary lifetime license. This is a discretionary
gesture of appreciation, not a formal program, and carries no guaranteed
terms, eligibility criteria, or entitlement.

4. TRANSITION TO A PAID VERSION
Northbyte Studios plans to introduce a paid version of Nexus after the beta
